---
/** 문제 진행 카드 — 수능·논술 목록 카드 */
---
<article class="hub-feature-card app-dashboard-hub-card" data-dashboard-card="progress">
  <h2 class="type-subhead">문제 진행</h2>
  <p class="type-caption chrome-muted" data-progress-subtitle>수능 0/0 · 논술 0/0</p>
  <p class="type-caption chrome-muted" data-progress-empty hidden>아직 완료한 문제가 없어요. 목록에서 첫 문항을 골라 보세요.</p>
  <div class="app-dashboard-problem-link-grid">
    <a href="/problems" class="app-dashboard-problem-link" data-progress-list="problem">
      <span class="app-dashboard-problem-link-title">수능 문제</span>
      <span class="app-dashboard-problem-link-meta" data-progress-list-meta>0% · 0/0</span>
      <div class="app-dashboard-ratio-bar" aria-hidden="true">
        <span data-progress-list-bar style="width: 0%"></span>
      </div>
      <span class="app-dashboard-problem-link-cta">문제 목록 보기 →</span>
    </a>
    <a href="/essay-problems" class="app-dashboard-problem-link" data-progress-list="essay">
      <span class="app-dashboard-problem-link-title">논술 문제</span>
      <span class="app-dashboard-problem-link-meta" data-progress-list-meta>0% · 0/0</span>
      <div class="app-dashboard-ratio-bar" aria-hidden="true">
        <span data-progress-list-bar style="width: 0%"></span>
      </div>
      <span class="app-dashboard-problem-link-cta">문제 목록 보기 →</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</article>
